==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|kǫttr}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈkʰœhtʏr]|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|œhtʏr|lang=is}}

===Noun===
'''köttur''' {{m}} ([[kattar]], [[kettir]])

# [[cat]]
#: Þú [[drepa|drapst]] '''köttinn''' minn, [[þess vegna]] [[líka|líkar]] mér [[illa]] [[við]] þig.''
#:: You killed my '''cat''', that's why I dislike you.

